  (fp_text user "Resonance Frequency: 500 Plus/Minus 20% Hz.\n- Impedance: 4 Ohm Plus/Minus 15% at 1 khz 1.0V.\n- Power: rated power / maximum power 2.0W / 3.0W\n- Sensitivity: 82 Plus/Minus 3dB (1w / 0.5m) at 1.0K Hz.\n- Effective frequency range: FO to 15 KHz.\n- Distortion factor: Less Than 5% MAX. (AT 1.0KHz 0.5W 0.5M)\n- Polarity: When a positive DC current is applied to the terminal marked +, the diaphragm shall move forward.\n- Buzz & rattle test: 4.0V FO to 15KHz.\n- High Temperature Storage Test: 80 Degree Celsius Plus/Minus 5 Degree Celsius - 96 Hours.\n- Low Temperature Storage Test: -40 Degree Celsius Plus/Minus 5 Degree Celsius - 96 Hours.\n- Magnet: Nd-Fe-B, 12.5mm * 2mm.\n- Size: 70mm * 31mm * 16mm.\n- Screw hole distance: 24mm * 63mm.\n- Interface: JST PH2.0 2-Pin.\n- Interface cable length: 40cm.\n- Total weight: 24g." (at 0.127 30.861 unlocked) (layer "Cmts.User")
